      "data": {
        "markdown": "## Graph Lab Membership\n\nEvery direct `.node` file in `graphs/` belongs to this collection. The folder is intentionally heterogeneous: demonstrations, architecture maps, experiments, smoke tests, and standalone models may live together here. The graph-owned controller presents ten ordinary root cards at a time.",
